			<item>
				<title>Boolean</title>
				<link>https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/scalars/boolean/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/scalars/boolean/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;boolean&#34;&gt;Boolean&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#boolean&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;Boolean&lt;/code&gt; scalar type represents &lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-graphql&#34; data-lang=&#34;graphql&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;scalar&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Boolean&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;member-of&#34;&gt;Member Of&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#member-of&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/operations/directives/include&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;include&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;directive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/language&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Language&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/operations/directives/skip&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;skip&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;directive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>ID</title>
				<link>https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/scalars/id/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/scalars/id/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;id&#34;&gt;ID&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#id&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;ID&lt;/code&gt; scalar type represents a unique identifier, often used to refetch an object or as key for a cache. The ID type appears in a JSON response as a String; however, it is not intended to be human-readable. When expected as an input type, any string (such as &lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;) or integer (such as &lt;code&gt;4&lt;/code&gt;) input value will be accepted as an ID.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-graphql&#34; data-lang=&#34;graphql&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;scalar&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;ID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;member-of&#34;&gt;Member Of&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#member-of&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/operations/queries/continent&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;continent&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/continent&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Continent&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/operations/queries/country&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;country&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/country&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Country&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/operations/queries/language&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;language&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;query&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/language&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Language&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/subdivision&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Subdivision&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>String</title>
				<link>https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/scalars/string/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/scalars/string/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;string&#34;&gt;String&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#string&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;String&lt;/code&gt; scalar type represents textual data, represented as UTF-8 character sequences. The String type is most often used by GraphQL to represent free-form human-readable text.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-graphql&#34; data-lang=&#34;graphql&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;scalar&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;member-of&#34;&gt;Member Of&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#member-of&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/continent&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Continent&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/country&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Country&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/directives/deprecated&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;deprecated&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;directive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/language&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Language&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/directives/specified-by&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;specifiedBy&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;directive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/state&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;State&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/inputs/string-query-operator-input&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;StringQueryOperatorInput&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-mdx-bullet&#34;&gt; ● &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://graphql-markdown.dev/demo-hugo/graphql/types/objects/subdivision&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Subdivision&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;gqlmd-badge&#34;&gt;object&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
